CAVEAT:  The supplicant was held at TLS 1.2 for STEP 2 and STEP 3.  So EAP-TLS over
         TLS 1.3 is NOT measured by this run.  At its default setting the
         supplicant used TLS 1.3 (STEP 4).  That leg stalled for 30 s and ended in
